      "extract": "Index for a Model of 3d-3d Correspondence for Plumbed 3-Manifolds Hee-Joong Chung Yau Mathematical Sciences Center, Tsinghua University, Beijing 100084, China Abstract: We consider the S2 ×q S1 supersymmetric index of a 3d N = 2 theory T[M3] when M3 is a plumbed 3-manifold. We engineer an eﬀective description of T[M3] from the expression of the homological block for plumbed 3-manifolds as a D2 ×q S1 partition",
