      "extract": "[]{#ssec:factorization label=\"ssec:factorization\"} We begin with a brief review on the formula for the index of the 3d $\\mathcal{N}=2$ theory with a Lagrangian description at the UV. ### Supersymmetric index on $S^2 \\times_q S^1$ The supersymmetric index on $S^2 \\times_q S^1$ with fugacities for flavor symmetries turned on was obtained in [@Kapustin-Willett] based on [@KimS; @Imamura-Yokoyama]. The 1-loop",
