      ],
      "extract": "When the 3-manifold is a lens space $M_3 = L(p,1) \\simeq S^3/\\mathbb{Z}_p$, the corresponding 3d $\\mathcal{N}=2$ theory $T[L(p,1)]$ has been discussed in [@Gadde-Gukov-Putrov-4manifold; @Chung-Dimofte-Gukov-Sulkowski; @Gukov-Pei] and more recently in [@Gukov-Putrov-Vafa; @Gukov-Pei-Putrov-Vafa] in the context of homological blocks. Since our analysis for the plumbed 3-manifolds can be regarded as an extrapolation of",
      "extractCut": true
    },
    {
