      "extract": "We consider the case $G=SU(2)$ with $t$ turned off. The homological block for a plumbed 3-manifold with $G=SU(2)$ [@Gukov-Pei-Putrov-Vafa; @Gukov-Manolescu] is given by $$\\begin{aligned} \\widehat{Z}_b (q) = (-1)^{\\pi} q^{\\frac{1}{4}(3 \\sigma - \\sum_v w_v)} \\text{ v.p.} \\oint_{|s_v|=1} \\prod_{v \\in \\text{Vertices}} \\frac{ds_v}{2\\pi i s_v} (s_v - s_v^{-1})^{2- \\text{deg}(v)} \\Theta_b^{-M}(\\vec{s}) \\label{plmb-orig}",
